 {"sec": "Resistant shock branches and ECMO · p258", "page": 258, "q": "What is the final step?", "opts": ["Plasmapheresis", "Palliation only", "ECMO", "High-dose steroids"], "ans": 2, "exp": "After excluding pericardial effusion/pneumothorax, the algorithm ends at ECMO. (Book p258)", "type": "case", "stem": "All shock measures fail and reversible causes are excluded in a deteriorating child.", "id": "PEDS-C54-126"},
